{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24412","headline":"奉和思黯自题南庄见示兼呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"奉和思黯自题南庄见示兼呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢家别墅最新奇，山展屏风花夹篱。\n晓月渐沈桥脚底，晨光初照屋梁时。\n台头有酒莺呼客，水面无尘风洗池。\n除却吟诗两闲客，此中情状更谁知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}